    "html": "<formula>E_v = \\frac{1}{3{,}6 \\times 10^6} \\int_{t_{0,v}}^{t_{1,v}} P_{\\text{el},v}(t) \\, dt \\quad [\\text{kWh}] \\quad (3.18)</formula>"
